me?"\n- Ask for the specific DATE and TIME. The AI must not assume a date/time.\n- If they say "Tomorrow", explicitly ask "What time tomorrow works best for you?"\n- After collecting both the date and time, thank them and end the call.\n- Extract the callback date as \'callback_date\' and the callback time as \'callback_time\' so the system can record it.\n\n\nINTEREST RULES\n\n- Use semantic intent to detect interest. Do not use simple keyword matching like if "no" is in the answer.\n- Explicit rejection (e.g., "I\'m not interested", "I don\'t want to continue", "I\'m not looking for this kind of opportunity") -> Result in marking them as Not Interested.\n- Temporary unavailability (e.g., "I\'m busy", "Call me later") -> Treat as Callback Required, NOT Not Interested.\n- Uncertainty (e.g., "I\'m not sure", "Can you tell me more?") -> Continue the conversation and provide details.\n\n\n\nMaintain a Professional & Conversational tone throughout the conversation.'}, 'recipient_phone_number': '+919142418268'}, 'agent_context_details': None, 'batch_run_details': None, 'provider': 'plivo', 'latency_data': {'stream_id': 108.61182, 'time_to_first_audio': 111.13843, 'region': 'in', 'transcriber': {'time_to_connect': 17, 'turns': [{'turn': 1, 'turn_latency': [{'sequence_id': 1, 'audio_to_text_latency': 16.45752, 'text': 'yes'}]}, {'turn': 2, 'turn_latency': [{'sequence_id': 1, 'audio_to_text_latency': 18.04053, 'text': 'yes'}]}, {'turn': 3, 'turn_latency': [{'sequence_id': 1, 'audio_to_text_latency': 15.57349, 'text': 'five'}]}, {'turn': 4, 'turn_latency': [{'sequence_id': 1, 'audio_to_text_latency': 427.20825, 'text': 'no'}]}]}, 'llm': {'time_to_connect': None, 'turns': [{'time_to_first_token': 539.4538, 'time_to_last_token': 687.03772, 'turn': 1}, {'time_to_first_token': 323.99235, 'time_to_last_token': 483.98472, 'turn': 2}, {'time_to_first_token': 298.79176, 'time_to_last_token': 495.53777, 'turn': 3}, {'time_to_first_token': 294.16309, 'time_to_last_token': 706.39168, '